WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,650 --> 00:00:04,090
Yes really

2
00:00:05,010 --> 00:00:07,370
Uncle Wang, what happened to Third Grandpa?

3
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,180
Ah Tian, look at it

4
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:16,380
Our team is really in trouble

5
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:23,780
The machinery field just ran out of food

6
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:25,820
Problems also occurred in the brigade.

7
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:31,760
It seems that the impact of this time will be seen sooner than I thought. The commune will not care about it.

8
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:33,160
let us solve it ourselves

9
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:35,280
But our brigade’s food reserves have long since bottomed out.

10
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:37,960
This year’s collection was already short of paying what was due.

11
00:00:37,960 --> 00:00:40,880
We've almost eaten the remaining food, so we just forgot about it.

12
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:42,680
Even if we use the last bit of seed food in the team,

13
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:43,840
Take out all the hard-earned food

14
00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:45,040
I can't last more than a few days.

15
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:48,240
Now every household doesn’t have much food storage.

16
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:50,640
Whose family didn't keep those things to save their lives?

17
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:51,800
It's really not possible

18
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:52,880
I take people into the mountains

19
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:54,200
Come back with more stuff

20
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:57,640
How many wild animals can there be in the mountains?

21
00:00:57,640 --> 00:00:59,240
Besides, it’s difficult for everyone now

22
00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:00,440
Go to another ring
